
CASE explicit small raw intensities
RAW_INTENSITY_ACCEPTED=TRUE
EFFECT_TYPE=log2FC
MAX_EFFECT_VS_LOG2_DIFFERENCE=3.65358853183165
Warning message:
`assay_type = "raw_intensity"` implies linear values, but the matrix only reaches 17.01, which looks already log-transformed. Transforming again would compress the dynamic range and shrink every fold change. 

CASE actual diff module late callback after switching projects
VIEW_EMPTY_AFTER_SWITCH=TRUE
LATE_SUCCESS_ADMITTED=TRUE
A_RESULT_STAMPED_AS_B=TRUE
WRONGLY_STAMPED_RESULT_VALID_IN_B=TRUE
LATE_ERROR_ADMITTED=TRUE
